# Personal, machine-local Claude Code settings (permissions, local paths) — not shared
.claude/settings.local.json
# Prompt Warden's calm log is a personal, machine-local record (the real one lives at ~/.claude/warden/)
.claude/warden/log.md
# Python bytecode caches — build artifacts, never committed
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# macOS Finder metadata — never ours, never committed
.DS_Store
